## Libraries and dependencies

The hardware program runs on an ESP32-C6 using MicroPython.

Libraries used:
- network Connects the ESP32 to Wi-Fi.
- time Sensor timing, reading age + timeouts.
- asyncio (Coordinates sensor sampling + HTTP Server tasks)
- machine (GPIO access + interrupt control)
- Microdot (Dashboard + API usage) 

